# Private Tracker (PT) Web & Image Proxy Rules
# Routing policy: mihomo RULE-SET pt-proxy -> Select
#                  Shadowrocket RULE-SET pt-proxy.txt -> Select
#
# Purpose: Web browsing, poster images, screenshots, and torrent file downloading
# for PT sites must go through proxy to bypass GFW and Cloudflare challenges.
# Tracker announces (pt-direct.list) are matched first and routed DIRECT.
# Verified against active DNS & HTTP endpoints.

